# Where the strike feed is served from.
#
# The page no longer connects to Blitzortung directly: `relay/` holds one
# socket to them and fans the frames out, which is what they ask a project
# using their data to do. Deploy it (`cd relay && npm run deploy`) and point
# this at it.
#
#   VITE_FEED_URL=wss://keraunos-relay.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev/feed
#
# Locally, `cd relay && npm run dev` serves the same thing unencrypted:
#   VITE_FEED_URL=ws://localhost:8787/feed
VITE_FEED_URL=
